6. Full Error Specification
6.1 Error Schema
The error schema defines the structure of an error deposit.

It has the following fields:

error_id. A string. Required.

error_name. A string. Required.

error_description. A string. Required.

subject. A string. Required.

topic. A string. Required.

error_type. An enum. Required. The values are conceptual, procedural, factual, computational, logical, strategic, careless, other.

underlying_misconception_reference. A string. Optional.

method_reference. A string. Optional.

learning_record_reference. A string. Optional.

recommended_intervention. An object. Required.

student_response. An object. Optional.

context. An object. Required.

frequency. An enum. Required. The values are one_time, occasional, frequent, very_frequent.

persistence. An enum. Required. The values are low, medium, high, very_high.

student_id. A string. Required.

date_observed. A string in ISO8601 format. Required.

date_last_observed. A string in ISO8601 format. Optional.

related_errors. An array of error relations. Optional.

provenance. An object. Required.

keywords. An array of strings. Optional.

notes. A string. Optional.

moderation_status. An enum. The values are pending, approved, rejected.

version. An integer.

supersedes. A string. Optional.

superseded_by. A string. Optional.

The recommended_intervention object has:

intervention_type. An enum. The values are direct_instruction, practice, feedback, peer_discussion, demonstration, worked_example, other.

intervention_description. A string.

intervention_reference. A string. Optional.

The student_response object has:

response_type. An enum. The values are corrected, partially_corrected, not_corrected, unknown.

response_date. A string in ISO8601 format.

response_notes. A string. Optional.

The context object has:

context_type. An enum. The values are homework, exam, class_work, project, tutoring, self_study, other.

context_description. A string.

problem_reference. A string. Optional.

Each error relation has:

relation_id. A string.

related_error_id. A string.

relation_type. An enum. The values are same_misconception, same_method, same_subject, related, independent.

relation_note. A string. Optional.

