6.3 Referential Integrity
Every error_relation.error_id and error_relation.related_error_id must exist in error_record.

Every misconception_link.error_id must exist in error_record.

Every method_link.error_id must exist in error_record.

Every learning_link.error_id must exist in error_record.

Every provenance.error_id must exist in error_record.

Every moderation.error_id must exist in error_record.

The version chain must be acyclic.

The error relation must be symmetric where appropriate.

