12. Validation Engine Design
The taxonomy validates the following.

Validation 1. Error validity. Every error is validated against the schema.

Validation 2. Referential integrity.

Validation 3. Version chain acyclicity.

Validation 4. Misconception resolution.

Validation 5. Method resolution.

Validation 6. Learning record resolution.

Validation 7. Provenance completeness.

Validation 8. Audit completeness.

Validation 9. Moderation completeness.

Validation 10. Frequency consistency. The frequency must be consistent with the date records.

Validation 11. Persistence consistency. The persistence must be consistent with the student response.

Validation 12. Student response date consistency. The response date must be after the observation date.

